Package: MPCurver
Type: Package
Title: Fit and Explore MPCurve Trajectory Models in R
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Ziang", "Zhang",
      email = "aguero.zhang@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Implements the MPCurve statistical model for trajectory and
    pseudotime inference via Gaussian mixture models with Gaussian Markov
    random field priors on smooth latent trajectories. Estimates sample
    positions, feature trajectories, and trajectory uncertainty using
    coordinate-ascent variational inference. Multi-ordering models use
    structural variational inference to jointly estimate latent orderings
    and probabilistic feature assignments. Supports feature-specific noise
    estimation or known measurement standard deviations, several
    initialization methods, and graphical summaries of fitted trajectories.
URL: https://aguerozz.github.io/MPCurver/,
    https://github.com/AgueroZZ/MPCurver
